WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.878 --> 00:00:17.146
"There was a big train crash," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:17.146 --> 00:00:19.623
"I have to help!"

3
00:00:19.623 --> 00:00:23.766
Roxy ran back to her friends.

4
00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.560
"I'll be right back, guys.

5
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:31.741
I want to go see the, um, crocodiles one more time!"

6
00:00:31.741 --> 00:00:35.367
"Wait!" called Jack as Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.958
"We'll come too. I love crocodiles!"

8
00:00:38.959 --> 00:00:42.445
But Roxy was already gone.

9
00:00:42.446 --> 00:00:44.883
Mara pointed at the sky.

10
00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:48.635
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:48.636 --> 00:00:53.719
Roxy flew over the train tracks until she reached the scene of the crash.

12
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.884
It was a huge mess.

13
00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:58.921
Cars from the two trains were jumbled together.

14
00:00:58.921 --> 00:01:02.793
Strange smoke poured from some cars and filled the air.

15
00:01:02.793 --> 00:01:06.084
Zoo animals were running in every direction.

16
00:01:06.085 --> 00:01:09.887
Police officers and a zookeeper were trying to catch them.

17
00:01:09.894 --> 00:01:13.160
Rocket Girl landed next to Detective Smith.

18
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:18.138
"Is there trouble with your train set, Detective?" she asked.

19
00:01:18.138 --> 00:01:21.900
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

20
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.262
"This is no time for jokes, Rocket Girl."

21
00:01:25.262 --> 00:01:27.538
"I know," said Roxy.

22
00:01:27.538 --> 00:01:29.864
"Was anybody hurt?"

23
00:01:29.864 --> 00:01:32.171
Detective Smith shook his head.

24
00:01:32.171 --> 00:01:35.454
"Luckily no people or animals were hurt.

25
00:01:35.454 --> 00:01:38.717
But now the animals are escaping."

26
00:01:38.717 --> 00:01:44.839
He coughed. "And this smoke is terrible.

27
00:01:44.839 --> 00:01:48.071
The firefighters can't get rid of it."

28
00:01:48.071 --> 00:01:49.973
Roxy looked around.

29
00:01:49.974 --> 00:01:53.815
Two firefighters were spraying the train cars with a hose.

30
00:01:53.815 --> 00:01:56.995
But the smoke was still thick.

31
00:01:56.995 --> 00:01:59.300
Roxy took a deep breath.

32
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:03.712
Then she blew as hard as she could. Whoosh!

33
00:02:03.712 --> 00:02:07.946
Her super breath blew away the smoke.

34
00:02:07.947 --> 00:02:10.655
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the zookeeper.

35
00:02:10.664 --> 00:02:13.499
"Now we can see the animals and catch them!"

36
00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:20.684
As the zookeeper and police officers chased animals, Roxy picked up train cars.

37
00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:25.214
She put them back on the tracks, one by one.

38
00:02:25.214 --> 00:02:29.194
Detective Smith came over with a toucan.

39
00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:32.992
"I think we caught all the animals," he said.

40
00:02:32.992 --> 00:02:36.844
"Let's count them to make sure," said the zookeeper.

41
00:02:36.844 --> 00:02:40.561
The zookeeper counted the animals.

42
00:02:40.561 --> 00:02:42.674
He made notes on a clipboard.

43
00:02:42.674 --> 00:02:45.741
When he was done, he scratched his head.

44
00:02:45.741 --> 00:02:52.431
"One animal is still missing."

45
00:02:52.432 --> 00:02:55.514
Then he gasped.

46
00:02:55.514 --> 00:02:57.695
"Where's Blue Baboon?"

47
00:02:57.695 --> 00:03:01.121
Suddenly a loud sound shook the ground.

48
00:03:01.121 --> 00:03:04.818
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

49
00:03:04.818 --> 00:03:06.573
The zookeeper frowned.

50
00:03:06.574 --> 00:03:09.267
"That sounds like Blue Baboon," he said.

51
00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:11.023
"But louder."

52
00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:14.669
Roxy nodded. "And bigger!"

53
00:03:14.669 --> 00:03:18.175
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

54
00:03:18.175 --> 00:03:20.112
The ground shook again.

55
00:03:20.112 --> 00:03:23.091
Everyone turned to look toward the sound.

56
00:03:23.091 --> 00:03:27.193
A huge cloud of chemical smoke moved across a farm field.

57
00:03:27.193 --> 00:03:30.553
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

58
00:03:30.554 --> 00:03:34.706
"There's something inside that chemical cloud," said Detective Smith.

59
00:03:34.707 --> 00:03:36.870
"Do you think it's . . . ?"

60
00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:39.572
The zookeeper dropped his clipboard.

61
00:03:39.572 --> 00:03:43.205
"Blue Baboon!"
